<title>POLAND: SWARZEDZ REVISES UP H1 LOSS.</title>
<headline>SWARZEDZ REVISES UP H1 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swarzedz SA final results for the</p>
<p>first six months ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						H1 96	  H1 95</p>
<p>    operating				0.83   vs    4.99</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			   6.68   vs    1.52 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				 6.68   vs    0.52 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Swarzedzkie Fabryki Mebli SA.</p>
<p>Earlier the company has reported its loss at 3.1 million</p>
<p>zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales			     49.39   vs   49.43</p>
<p>    costs of sales			39.66   vs   36.81</p>
