<p>    financial revenues		   0.20   vs    0.49</p>
<p>    financial costs			7.72   vs    4.00</p>
<p>    investment			     2.56   vs    1.03</p>
<p>    depreciation			   1.88   vs    1.57</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
